"│                                    ││ No logs: this server was started outside Paddock, so its   │"
"│                                    ││output only goes to its own terminal. To see logs here:     │"
"│                                    ││                                                            │"
"│                                    ││ 1 Press x to stop it (otherwise the new copy gets another  │"
"│                                    ││port).                                                      │"
